{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"aea65afe0e5862ee36486d1d8f71c20a1bc4c3aa5415828aa0c58b4c80057d03","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["犹大王乌西雅、约阿施的儿子以色列王耶罗波安执政期间，大地震前两年，提哥亚的牧人阿摩司看到了关于以色列的异象。以下是阿摩司的话。"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"他说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“耶和华从锡安怒吼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从耶路撒冷发声。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牧人的草场枯干，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦密山顶枯黄。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["对亚兰的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“大马士革人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回对他们的惩罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们用打粮食的铁器蹂躏基列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在哈薛的王宫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧毁便·哈达的城堡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要折断大马士革城的门闩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铲除亚文平原","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"的居民和伯·伊甸的掌权者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使亚兰人被掳到吉珥","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["对非利士的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“迦萨人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回对他们的惩罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们把被掳之人全都带走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卖到以东做奴隶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在迦萨的城墙上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧毁它的城堡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要铲除亚实突的居民和亚实基伦的掌权者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伸手攻击以革伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剩下的非利士人都要灭亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["对泰尔的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“泰尔人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回对他们的惩罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们背弃弟兄之盟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把被掳之人都卖到以东。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在泰尔的城墙上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧毁它的城堡。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["对以东的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“以东人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回对他们的惩罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们拔刀追赶自己的弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有半点怜悯之心；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们怒气不息，永怀愤怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在提幔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧毁波斯拉的城堡。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["对亚扪的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“亚扪人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回对他们的惩罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们为了扩张领土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竟剖开基列孕妇的肚腹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要在战争的呐喊声中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在狂风暴雨袭来时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"降火在拉巴的城墙上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧毁它的城堡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的君王和首领要一同被掳。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“亚文平原”希伯来文是“邪恶谷”。亚文平原和伯·伊甸皆属于亚兰人。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"吉珥的位置不详，亚兰人原来自吉珥。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}